                     <note>5:83-6:110. Red verse markers formed as dots, commas or letters hā. Ihmāl marks (rā’-s,kāf-s). Some extensions of words into the margin or words left uncompleted at the end of a line without diacritics or vocalization, and written in full on the following line. Words completed on the following line. Corrections between the lines, and few in the margin. Deletions. Irregular catchwords from another hand, more recent than the matn, and casual. </note>
